"P1155785077" "I have watched your exploits in the Hollows for quite some time, {HeroName}. Yes. I know everything that goes on in the Hollows. Almost everything, that is. I have not yet been able to locate the mighty gateway that calls to all of magic blood. But rest assured, I will. The only thing standing in my way is this cursed infestation of evil-doers. At the moment, the greatest threat is the Trolls' continued tunneling. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you defeat some of their members, to show them that their kind is most unwelcome here?</a>"
